<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Logo &amp; brand identity</h3><p>A logo and visual system built around your positioning — not a mark chosen in isolation. We explore directions, refine the strongest one, and deliver a logo that works everywhere, from a business card to a hoarding.</p></div>
<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Brand guidelines &amp; stationery</h3><p>Clear guidelines for colour, typography, imagery and tone, plus the everyday stationery your team actually uses — so every document, email and presentation looks like it came from the same business.</p></div>
<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Brochures &amp; presentations</h3><p>Printed and digital brochures, company profiles and presentations that explain what you do without drowning the reader. Design and <a href="/copyright/">copywriting</a> work together, so the words and the visuals say the same thing.</p></div>
<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Exhibition &amp; signage design</h3><p>Stands, banners, hoardings and signage that carry your identity into the physical world. We design for the distance people see it from and the few seconds you have to hold their attention — and our <a href="/print/">print &amp; outdoor team</a> can take it through to production.</p></div>
<p class="caption">Your project scope, deliverables and timeline are agreed after our first conversation.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">WHO IT’S FOR</span><h2>Who this service is for</h2><p>Good identity work is not only for new businesses. We design for companies launching a brand, established businesses whose look no longer matches their ambition, and organisations that need one consistent identity across many materials and many people.</p></div>
<div class="values">
<article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Real estate</h3><p>Identities and brochures for developers and property brands that need to look credible before the first site visit.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>E-commerce</h3><p>Packaging, product graphics and digital assets that help an online store stand out in a crowded feed.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Calm, trustworthy identities for clinics and care providers, where clarity matters more than decoration.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Education</h3><p>Prospectuses, admission campaigns and identities for schools and institutes that speak to students and parents alike.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>05</span><h3>B2B &amp; industrial</h3><p>Serious, considered branding for manufacturers and service firms that sell on expertise and reliability.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>06</span><h3>FMCG &amp; retail</h3><p>Shelf-ready packaging and retail graphics designed to be recognised quickly and remembered easily.</p></article>
</div></section>
